---
system: sys-04-realtime-session-orchestrator
flow_id: session-start-mobile
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/04-realtime-session-orchestrator#post-v1sessionsstart
actors: [ParentApp, Gateway, RealtimeService, MqttBroker, Device, PostgreSQL, Redis, BillingService]
apis:
  - POST /v1/sessions/start
externals: []
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - entitlement_check_failed
  - device_offline
  - device_busy_other_session
  - parent_stop_cooldown_active
  - idempotency_replay_410
idempotency: Idempotency-Key header; stored in idempotency_keys table; 24h dedup window; non-OPEN state returns 410 Gone with Retry-With-New-Key=true
retry: caller-side exponential backoff with jitter on 5xx only — NOT on 423 cooldown, NOT on 409 entitlement
timeout: 5s p99 for POST; MQTT delivery + WS handshake async — parent app receives session.started observer event within ~3s in happy path
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant RealtimeService
    participant BillingService
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant Redis
    participant MqttBroker
    participant Device

    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/sessions/start {user_id, child_id, device_id, course_id} and Idempotency-Key header and Bearer token
    Gateway->>Gateway: rate-limit (sys-17) and JWT verify
    Gateway->>RealtimeService: forward request

    RealtimeService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT idempotency_keys WHERE key=Idempotency-Key
    alt idempotency_replay_410
        PostgreSQL-->>RealtimeService: row found, state != OPEN
        RealtimeService-->>Gateway: 410 Gone {Retry-With-New-Key: true}
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 410
    else key already OPEN (in-flight dedup)
        PostgreSQL-->>RealtimeService: row found, state=OPEN
        RealtimeService-->>Gateway: 202 Accepted (replay — original request still processing)
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 202
    else new key
        PostgreSQL-->>RealtimeService: not found
        RealtimeService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT idempotency_keys (key, state=OPEN, user_id, created_at)

        RealtimeService->>BillingService: GET /v1/billing/entitlement {user_id, child_id}
        alt entitlement_check_failed
            BillingService-->>RealtimeService: 403 entitlement_check_failed {reason: subscription_lapsed|no_plan}
            RealtimeService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE idempotency_keys SET state=FAILED
            RealtimeService-->>Gateway: 403 entitlement_check_failed
            Gateway-->>ParentApp: 403
        else entitlement granted
            BillingService-->>RealtimeService: 200 {entitled: true, remaining_minutes}

            RealtimeService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT users.parent_stop_cooldown_until WHERE user_id=user_id
            alt parent_stop_cooldown_active
                PostgreSQL-->>RealtimeService: cooldown_until > NOW()
                RealtimeService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE idempotency_keys SET state=FAILED
                RealtimeService-->>Gateway: 423 parent_stop_cooldown_active {retry_after: cooldown_until}
                Gateway-->>ParentApp: 423
            else no cooldown
                PostgreSQL-->>RealtimeService: cooldown_until IS NULL or past

                RealtimeService->>Redis: GET device_session:{device_id}
                alt device_busy_other_session
                    Redis-->>RealtimeService: existing session_id
                    RealtimeService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE idempotency_keys SET state=FAILED
                    RealtimeService-->>Gateway: 409 device_busy_other_session {active_session_id}
                    Gateway-->>ParentApp: 409
                else device slot free
                    Redis-->>RealtimeService: nil

                    RealtimeService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT realtime_sessions {session_id, user_id, child_id, device_id, device_session_id=uuid(), state=CONNECTING, state_version=0, course_id, created_at}
                    %% unique partial index on (user_id, device_id) WHERE state IN (CONNECTING,ACTIVE,RECONNECTING,PAUSED,INTERRUPTED) enforces one active session
                    PostgreSQL-->>RealtimeService: OK

                    alt device_offline
                        Note over RealtimeService,MqttBroker: MQTT publish attempted but device not subscribed
                        RealtimeService->>MqttBroker: PUBLISH device/{device_id}/sessions/start {session_id, device_session_id, child_id, course_id}
                        MqttBroker-->>RealtimeService: PUBACK (broker accepted, device delivery not confirmed)
                        Note over RealtimeService: session stays CONNECTING, expires after 30s if Device never opens WS
                        RealtimeService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE idempotency_keys SET state=COMPLETE
                        RealtimeService-->>Gateway: 200 {session_id, expires_at, state: CONNECTING}
                        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
                        Note over ParentApp: attaches observer lane (see observer-attach.sequence.mmd) — receives session.start_failed if device never connects
                    else device online and reachable
                        RealtimeService->>MqttBroker: PUBLISH device/{device_id}/sessions/start {session_id, device_session_id, child_id, course_id}
                        MqttBroker-->>RealtimeService: PUBACK
                        MqttBroker-)Device: deliver device/{device_id}/sessions/start
                        %% Device receives MQTT push and opens WS to RealtimeService
                        %% see also: docs/sequences/04-realtime/ws-handshake.sequence.mmd
                        Device-)RealtimeService: (async) WS connect wss://realtime/v1/connect?session_id&device_session_id
                        RealtimeService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE realtime_sessions SET state=ACTIVE, state_version=1 WHERE session_id
                        RealtimeService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE idempotency_keys SET state=COMPLETE
                        RealtimeService-->>Gateway: 200 {session_id, expires_at, state: CONNECTING}
                        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200
                        Note over ParentApp: transitions to cl_running / CompanionScreen — attaches observer lane — receives session.started event within ~3s
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over ParentApp,Device: POST times out at 5s p99 — MQTT delivery and WS handshake async — retry only on 5xx with jitter — no retry on 423/409/410
